  <!-- EN: breach jump -->
  <SCWC_BreachJump.label>破壁跳躍</SCWC_BreachJump.label>

  <!-- EN: Fire the armor's drop thrusters to jump to a location, landing hard enough to breach walls and hull plating. The jump is short, but it does not need a clear path. -->
  <SCWC_BreachJump.description>啟動裝甲的空降推進器跳向指定位置，著陸的力道足以撞穿牆壁與船體裝甲。跳躍距離雖短，但不需要暢通的路徑。</SCWC_BreachJump.description>

  <!-- EN: In vacuum the burn has no range limit, but needs a clear line to the target. -->
  <SCWC_BreachJump.modExtensions.0.vacuumDescription>在真空中推進沒有距離限制，但與目標之間不能有任何阻擋。</SCWC_BreachJump.modExtensions.0.vacuumDescription>

